{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01Ac5SMYs5GaqxFdLtV73LqU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012PPHx34Z6TLtKMmiq2kfso","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/samueledwards/RalphWiggumV3/WORK_SUMMARY.md","content":"# Work Summary\n\n## Session Overview\n- **Date**: 2026-01-16\n- **Mode**: Verification and Integration\n- **Git Tag Created**: v0.0.8\n\n## What Was Implemented\n\nThis session completed the final integration work for Feature Set 13 (LLM-as-Judge Review System):\n\n1. **useWebSocket.ts Updates**\n   - Added imports for `ReviewRunnerStatus`, `ReviewConfig`, `ReviewResult` types\n   - Added state variables: `reviewRunnerStatus`, `reviewRunnerOutput`, `reviewRunnerResult`, `reviewRunnerError`\n   - Added message handlers for `review:status`, `review:output`, `review:complete`, `review:error`, `review:cancelled`\n   - Added handler functions: `runReview`, `cancelReview`, `clearReviewOutput`\n   - Updated return interface and return object with all new state/handlers\n\n2. **types/index.ts Updates**\n   - Added `ReviewCancelledMessage` interface for the `review:cancelled` message type\n   - Added `ReviewCancelledMessage` to the `ServerMessage` union type\n\n3. **Dashboard.tsx Updates**\n   - Added import for `ReviewPanel` component and `Sparkles` icon\n   - Destructured new review runner state/handlers from useWebSocket\n   - Added \"Quality Review\" as a 4th sub-tab under the Generate tab\n   - Integrated `ReviewPanel` component with proper props\n\n4. **tasks.json Updates**\n   - Synchronized with IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md\n   - Updated all tasks 83-105 status to \"done\"\n   - Added tasks 97-105 for Feature Set 14 (Code Review Mode)\n\n## Key Decisions\n\n1. **Tab Placement**: ReviewPanel was added as \"Quality Review\" tab under Generate, alongside Implementation Plan, Code Review, and PRD & Audience tabs. This provides logical grouping of AI-powered generation/review tools.\n\n2. **Naming Convention**: Used \"Quality Review\" for the LLM-as-Judge feature to distinguish from \"Code Review\" (Feature Set 14) which analyzes code vs documentation.\n\n3. **State Separation**: Kept review runner state (`reviewRunnerStatus`) separate from review generator state (`reviewGeneratorStatus`) to maintain Feature Set 13 and 14 as independent systems.\n\n## Issues Resolved\n\n1. **Missing Type**: Added `ReviewCancelledMessage` which was emitted by the backend but not defined in types\n2. **tasks.json Out of Sync**: Updated to reflect actual implementation status of all Feature Sets 12-14\n\n## Remaining Work\n\nNone - All 105 implementation tasks are complete:\n- Feature Sets 1-14: COMPLETE\n- Verification checklist items (lint, manual testing) are noted as pre-existing/not-blocking\n\n## Learnings\n\n1. **Two Review Systems**: The codebase has two distinct review systems:\n   - **ReviewRunner/ReviewPanel** (Feature Set 13): LLM-as-Judge for subjective quality criteria\n   - **ReviewGenerator** (Feature Set 14): Code review mode analyzing implementation vs documentation\n\n2. **WebSocket Message Patterns**: Server broadcasts `review:*` messages that frontend hook must handle to enable UI updates\n\n3. **Build Validation**: TypeScript compilation (`tsc --noEmit`) and Vite build (`npm run build`) are reliable validation steps\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":160,"cache_read_input_tokens":109752,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":160,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e963dfad-ac1f-43fb-a8da-b2590f97a0fb","uuid":"2516013f-d01a-4ec7-bdd8-1282b7f25c8a"}
